    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvercall\u200b\u200b is a retro pixel-style action-adventure RPG blending precision platforming, fast combat, and exploration. Play as an amnesiac adventurer fighting monsters, leaping through perilous terrain, and collecting Memory Crystals to uncover your lost past\u2014and the dark truth behind Aishe\u2019s rise as the &quot;Saintess.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Platforming + Fast-Paced Combat \u2013 Master challenging jumps and engage in thrilling battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted Levels \u2013 Nearly 100 meticulously designed stages that test your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory Crystals \u2013 Collect over 100 fragments to gradually reveal the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings \u2013 Your fate depends on how much of your memory you restore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Depth \u2013 Collection mechanics, weapon upgrades, and an achievement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast Arsenal \u2013 20+ weapons, 20+ armor pieces, and 30+ accessories, each with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Boss Fights &amp; NPCs \u2013 Diverse challenges and rich interactions await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to reclaim your past\u2014and decide the future.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvercall\u200b\u200b is a retro pixel-style action-adventure RPG blending precision platforming, fast combat, and exploration. Play as an amnesiac adventurer fighting monsters, leaping through perilous terrain, and collecting Memory Crystals to uncover your lost past\u2014and the dark truth behind Aishe\u2019s rise as the &quot;Saintess.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Platforming + Fast-Paced Combat \u2013 Master challenging jumps and engage in thrilling battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted Levels \u2013 Nearly 100 meticulously designed stages that test your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory Crystals \u2013 Collect over 100 fragments to gradually reveal the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings \u2013 Your fate depends on how much of your memory you restore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Depth \u2013 Collection mechanics, weapon upgrades, and an achievement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast Arsenal \u2013 20+ weapons, 20+ armor pieces, and 30+ accessories, each with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Boss Fights &amp; NPCs \u2013 Diverse challenges and rich interactions await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to reclaim your past\u2014and decide the future.</p>",
